{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44307","headline":"诗三百三首 四 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾家好隐沦，居处绝嚣尘。\n践草成三径，瞻云作四邻。\n助歌声有鸟，问法语无人。\n今日娑婆树，几年爲一春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}